MindForge AI Risk Management — source provenance

Source: Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) / Association of Banks in
Singapore (ABS) — "MindForge AI Risk Management" (Nov 2025), built on FEAT
(2018) and the Veritas initiative; risk taxonomy from Appendix B; ABS "Handbook
on Generative AI Guardrails in Banking" (May 2025) for the ten top Gen AI risks.

This catalog stores only framework codes/titles and ORIGINAL-WORDING summaries
authored for this project. It contains NO verbatim normative text from the
MindForge publications. Raw source PDFs are deliberately kept OUT of this
repository. Reuse terms follow the MAS/ABS publication; confirm before
redistributing derived content.